# Figma is the only design source

Frontend is Angular. Backend is Node.js. The website must match this file:

`https://www.figma.com/design/VyzG2wtedK6PXKrab7G3aj/Design-DFT-i3c--NEW-` page **Design System** (`0:1`).

Before writing or changing UI, read the matching Figma section and copy its color, type, spacing, radius, and states. Do not invent a color, font, spacing, radius, shadow, or layout. Use a color only for the usage written in `design-system/colors.ts`.

